    "detailed_description": "After a series of cataclysms, the Ahori tribe lost faith in their god.<br>They decided to send their fiercest warrior to put an end to his wrath.<br>Propelled into the divine dimension, our heroine Aohri set off armed with her bow to slay her fallen god.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200400/extras/8a57c9f3b61c57d18b246e5214ca7ff3.poster.avif?t=1717333608\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200400/extras/8a57c9f3b61c57d18b246e5214ca7ff3.webm?t=1717333608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200400/extras/8a57c9f3b61c57d18b246e5214ca7ff3.mp4?t=1717333608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Fight for survival in this third-person shooter.<br>Pursue a ruthless enemy in explosive battles full of twists and turns and projectiles. :<br><br>-Shoot<br>-Move<br>-Modify your shot<br>-Dash<br>-Slow down enemy projectiles<br><br>Explore a vast world full of danger:<br><br>-Towers that fire projectiles<br>-Platforms that break<br>-Trapped temple walls<br>-Sharp blades<br>-Temple axes<br>-Rotating blades",
    "about_the_game": "After a series of cataclysms, the Ahori tribe lost faith in their god.<br>They decided to send their fiercest warrior to put an end to his wrath.<br>Propelled into the divine dimension, our heroine Aohri set off armed with her bow to slay her fallen god.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200400/extras/8a57c9f3b61c57d18b246e5214ca7ff3.poster.avif?t=1717333608\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200400/extras/8a57c9f3b61c57d18b246e5214ca7ff3.webm?t=1717333608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200400/extras/8a57c9f3b61c57d18b246e5214ca7ff3.mp4?t=1717333608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Fight for survival in this third-person shooter.<br>Pursue a ruthless enemy in explosive battles full of twists and turns and projectiles. :<br><br>-Shoot<br>-Move<br>-Modify your shot<br>-Dash<br>-Slow down enemy projectiles<br><br>Explore a vast world full of danger:<br><br>-Towers that fire projectiles<br>-Platforms that break<br>-Trapped temple walls<br>-Sharp blades<br>-Temple axes<br>-Rotating blades",
    "short_description": "Embark on an adventure, driven by vengeance, to hunt down your former god and put an end to his reign to restore balance to the world!",
